 style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">학기&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">수강지도상담</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">을 아래와 같이 안내하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">해당 학생들은 수강지도기간에 지도교수와 상담하여&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">“</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">수강지도상담</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">”</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">을</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">받으시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 0.5pt; margin-left: 0.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">수강지도 미승인 학생은 수강신청 불가, 수강꾸러미 삭제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 0.5pt; margin-left: 0.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 6pt; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 6pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 0.5pt; margin-left: 0.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">상담대상</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">학년도 1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">학기 재학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 33.6pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp; ※ 2024-1학기&nbsp;학적변동자(복학생,신입생,편입생,재입학생) 및&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 17.3333px; text-indent: -44.8px;\">졸업유예생</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -33.6pt;\">은 수강지도 상담이 원칙이지만, 수강신청 및 수강꾸러미 기간을 고려하여 수강지도 미실시하더라도&nbsp;수강신청&nbsp;제한하지 않음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 33.6pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 17.3333px; text-indent: -44.8px;\">&nbsp; ※ 학기초과자는 수강지도상담 의무실시</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 0.5pt; margin-left: 0.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 0.5pt; margin-left: 0.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">2</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">수강지도 상담 기간&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">:<b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\">1</span></span></b></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\">. 29.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\">) 09:00 ~ 2. 8.(목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\">) 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\">까지</span></b></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"7042\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"m